  "body": "Credit for the explainer and examples goes to @scottaohara, only minor adjustments were made.\n\n#### Proposal\n\n1. [Design]( https://kaleidea.github.io/whatwg-search-proposal/#design-decisions )\n1. [Motivation]( https://kaleidea.github.io/whatwg-search-proposal/#motivation )\n\n\n#### Implementations (proof-of-concept)\n\n- [Chromium]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/chromium/commits/search-element )\n- [WebKit]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/WebKit/commits/search-element )\n- Firefox in progress\n\n\n#### Specification (generated)\n\n- [Readable form]( https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/forms.html#the-search-element )\n- Meaningful changes:\n    - [`action` attr]( https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/form-control-infrastructure.html#attr-fs-action )\n    - [forms]( https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/forms.html ) section\n    - [indices]( https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/indices.html )\n- Editorial changes: \"form element(s)\" -> \"form(s)\" / \"form owner\", etc.\n    - Most: [form-control-infrastructure]( https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/form-control-infrastructure.html )\n\n\n#### Specification source\n\n- [Categorised changes]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/whatwg-html/commits/search-form ):\n    - What developers will read: [\"The search element\" section]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/whatwg-html/commit/ffb121049e7593c8ee0fdd2024484d30d0c2b5db )\n    - [Add the `<search>` element to tag lists]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/whatwg-html/commit/51bd17e8c4cb3e86938671eddf002f7d0c80bc34 )\n    - Systematic changes: [Rewording \"form elements\" -> \"forms\", etc.]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/whatwg-html/commit/fbb1c7de652290c3ab455f5c8f1d83a598942fc9 )\n    - Optional: [Clarification notes]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/whatwg-html/commit/4d85297a8217a047283c15d93bf056e20d56cf53 )\n- This PR contains the [breakdown of changes]( https://github.com/Kaleidea/whatwg-html/commits/search-form-detailed ): each commit contains a different transformation pattern for quicker verification of the systematic editorial changes.\n\n\n#### Design decisions\n\n- `<search>` is implemented by `HTMLFormElement`.\n- If the `action` attribute is not set then form submission is disabled (`method=dialog` still closes an ancestor dialog).\n- Empty `action=\"\"` attribute is valid - contrary to `<form>` -, behaves as if `action` is unset on a `<form>`: submits to the document's base URL.\n- The parser treats `<search>` as a `<form>`: nesting of `<search>` and `<form>` is invalid in any combination. Invalid DOM with nesting can still be constructed with JS, behaves as nested `form`s do.\n- `<search>` cannot be a shadow root: `.attachShadow()` is not allowed (like `<form>`, but unlike `<div>`). ([MDN]( https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/attachShadow#elements_you_can_attach_a_shadow_to ))\n\n\n#### Prerequisites\n\n- [ ] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n    * TODO: Seeking contact.\n- [ ] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n    * TODO: Awaiting feedback for the proof-of-concept implementations.\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n    * Chrome: TODO\n    * Firefox: TODO\n    * Safari: TODO\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes]( https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes ) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/common-dom-interfaces.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/common-dom-interfaces.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/common-dom-interfaces.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/custom-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/form-control-infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/form-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/forms.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/forms.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/forms.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/input.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/input.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/input.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/interactive-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/interactive-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/interactive-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/obsolete.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/obsolete.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/obsolete.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/rendering.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/semantics-other.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/semantics-other.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/semantics-other.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/semantics.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/semantics.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/semantics.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/syntax.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/syntax.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/syntax.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/7382/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">/window-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7382/e9ba78f...0e6833b/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 2, 2021, 6:58 AM UTC (0e6833b)\">diff</a> )",
